BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//WorkBuddy//Game Version Calendar//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Epic Free Games - Calendar
X-WR-CALDESC:Reminders for Epic's weekly free games and the Winter Sale mys
 tery giveaways. Leaving a game? On iPhone just delete that calendar. On An
 droid\, switch OFF "show" in Calendar account settings instead of tapping 
 Delete - deleting one URL subscription removes all of them.
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Asia/Shanghai
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:PT6H
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:PT6H
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:epic-20261120-giveaway@game-version-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261114T120000Z
DTSTART:20261119T160000Z
DTEND:20261119T161500Z
SUMMARY:Epic free game rotation (Computed)
DESCRIPTION:Epic swaps its free game every Thursday at 11:00 ET\, which is 
 00:00 Friday in Beijing time.\nWhile US daylight saving is on (mid-March t
 o early November) it lands an hour earlier\, at 23:00 Thursday.\n\nWhateve
 r you claim stays in your library permanently. The window is open 7 days\,
  until the next rotation.\n\nClaim at epicgames.com/store/free-games or in
  the launcher under Store > Free Games.\nSome titles are region-locked and
  show as unavailable on certain accounts.\n\nAll times are Beijing time (U
 TC+8).\nEntries marked Estimated or TBC are projected from version cycles 
 or past schedules and may shift once officially announced.
LOCATION:Epic Free Games - Claim page
CATEGORIES:Epic Free Games
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT1H
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Epic rotates its free game in 1 hour
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:PT0S
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Epic swapped its free game - claim it now
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
