UID:epic-Winter-giveaway@game-version-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261114T120000Z
DTSTART:20261217T160000Z
DTEND:20261217T161500Z
SUMMARY:Epic Winter Sale mystery giveaways begin (Estimated)
DESCRIPTION:Projected from past years: the Epic Winter Sale starts in mid-D
 ecember and\, from day one\,\ngives away one mystery game per day\, each c
 laimable for only 24 hours\, for roughly 15 days.\n\nEpic has not announce
 d the 2026 dates yet\, so this one is an estimate and may be off by a few 
 days\;\nthe entry is corrected once the dates go official.\n\nMind the dif
 ference: normally a game stays claimable for 7 days\, but during the sale 
 it changes\nat 00:00 every day and a missed day is gone for good.\n\nClaim
  at epicgames.com/store/free-games\n\nAll times are Beijing time (UTC+8).
 \nEntries marked Estimated or TBC are projected from version cycles or pas
 t schedules and may shift once officially announced.
LOCATION:Epic Free Games - Claim page
CATEGORIES:Epic Free Games
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT1H
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Epic rotates its free game in 1 hour
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:PT0S
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Epic swapped its free game - claim it now
END:VALARM
